<title>USA: LifeQuest finalizes Val-U-Med acquisition.</title>
<headline>LifeQuest finalizes Val-U-Med acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>LifeQuest Medical Inc said it finalized its acquisition of Val-U-Med Inc, an Atlanta-based company which distributes instruments, equipment and surgical supplies used in minimally invasive surgery.</p>
<p>LifeQuest said it bought Val-U-Med for 1.2 million LifeQuest common shares and $400,000 in cash.</p>
<p>The acquisition was part of LifeQuest's plan to become a major competitor in the minimally invasive surgery market through internal growth and acquisitions.</p>
</text>
